## To native args () -> Seq of Text
## To native parseInt (s: Text) -> Int

## Main
Let arguments be args().
Let n be word64(parseInt(item 2 of arguments)).
Let count be word64(0).
Let i be word64(2).
While i is at most n:
    Let isPrime be word64(1).
    Let d be word64(2).
    While d * d is at most i:
        If i % d equals word64(0):
            Set isPrime to word64(0).
            Break.
        Set d to d + word64(1).
    If isPrime equals word64(1):
        Set count to count + word64(1).
    Set i to i + word64(1).
Show count.
